Package: xharness
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: XHarness Maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Depends: libc6, ca-certificates, bash, util-linux, ripgrep, bubblewrap (>= 0.6), apparmor, apparmor-utils, apparmor-profiles
Description: Rust coding-agent host with native sandbox setup
 XHarness provides a provider-neutral Rust agent loop, Web host, and native
 coding tools. Installation configures and verifies a restricted Bubblewrap
 execution backend without globally disabling AppArmor user-namespace policy.
